1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Sheldon walks into the living room, looking unusually serious, Sheldon.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Dad, I have a question for you.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
George, busy with something, barely looks up.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Not a good time, Sheldon.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Sheldon, persistent as always.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Please, it's really important.

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
George sighs and finally looks up, trying to remain patient.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Whatever it is, fine.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Sheldon takes a deep breath, preparing for what he's about to say.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Sheldon, mom, dad said I can drop out of college.

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Mary, who's been in the kitchen, hears this and immediately rushes into the room.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Mary, what?

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
George, caught completely off guard, stares at Sheldon in utter disbelief.

14
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:52,000
George, oh, Sheldon, with his usual deadpan expression, looks between his parents, satisfied with the chaos he's just caused.

